---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact Prime IPTV: 24/7 Support Canada" description="Contact Prime IPTV support 24/7 via WhatsApp or email. Fast response for subscription, setup, and billing questions.">
  <Header slot="header" />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:700px; text-align:center;">
      <div class="section-label"><Icon name="chat" size={14} />Contact</div>
      <h1 class="section-title">Contact Prime IPTV</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:3rem;">Our support team is available 24/7. Reach us by WhatsApp or email for help with subscriptions, setup, billing or any other question.</p>
      <div class="contact-cards">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="c-icon"><Icon name="chat" size={28} /></div>
          <h2>WhatsApp</h2>
          <p>Fastest response. Available 24/7 for all support needs.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/14062356618" class="btn-primary" style="justify-content:center;">Message on WhatsApp</a>
          <p class="c-detail">+1 (406) 235-6618</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="c-icon"><Icon name="mail" size={18} /> </div>
          <h2>Email</h2>
          <p>Send us an email and we will reply as soon as we can.</p>
          <a href="mailto:contactiptv.amelia@gmail.com" class="btn-outline" style="justify-content:center;">Send Email<Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a>
          <p class="c-detail">contactiptv.amelia@gmail.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tips-box">
        <h3>Get a faster answer</h3>
        <p>When you message us about a problem, include your device and player app, the channel name, the time it happened and what you see on screen. Many problems can also be fixed in the <a href="/help/">help center</a> or with our <a href="/blog/iptv-buffering-troubleshooting/">buffering and login checklist</a> or the <a href="/setup/">device setup guides</a>. For plans and prices, see <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a>; for common questions, the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tips-box">
        <h3>What we can help with</h3>
        <p>Choosing a plan or number of connections &middot; requesting the 24-hour free trial &middot; ordering and payment &middot; receiving or re-sending your login &middot; setting up on your device &middot; buffering, login or TV-guide problems &middot; refunds under the 7-day money-back guarantee &middot; <a href="/reseller/">reseller enquiries</a>. Support is available 24/7.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="address-box">
        <h3><Icon name="map-pin" size={18} class="ic-accent" /> Business Address</h3>
        <p>97 Hocken Ave, Toronto, ON M6G 2K1, Canada</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
<style>
  .contact-cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1.5rem; margin-bottom:2rem; }
  .contact-card { background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px; padding:2rem; text-align:center; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.75rem; }
  .c-icon { font-size:2.5rem; }
  .contact-card h2 { font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; margin:0; }
  .contact-card p { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.875rem; margin:0; }
  .c-detail { color:var(--brand) !important; font-weight:600; }
  .tips-box { background:var(--bg-2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; margin-top:1rem; text-align:left; }
  .tips-box h3 { font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 0.5rem; }
  .tips-box p { color:var(--muted); margin:0; font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.65; }
  .tips-box a { color:var(--brand); font-weight:600; }
  .address-box { background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:1.5rem; margin-top:1rem; }
  .address-box h3 { font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 0.5rem; }
  .address-box p { color:var(--muted); margin:0; font-size:0.9rem; }
  @media (max-width:600px) { .contact-cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
